<sec id="lorem-ipsum-overview">
  <title>Lorem Ipsum Overview</title>
  <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, <italic>consectetur</italic> adipiscing
  elit, sed do <bold>eiusmod</bold> tempor incididunt ut labore et
  <monospace>dolore_magna</monospace> aliqua. See the
  <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="https://example.com/docs" xlink:title="Example title">example
  site</ext-link> for more.</p>
  <sec id="lists-and-structure">
    <title>Lists and Structure</title>
    <p>Ut enim ad minim veniam:</p>
    <list list-type="bullet">
      <list-item>
        <p>First bullet item</p>
      </list-item>
      <list-item>
        <p>Second bullet item</p>
        <list list-type="bullet">
          <list-item>
            <p>Nested alpha</p>
          </list-item>
          <list-item>
            <p>Nested beta</p>
          </list-item>
        </list>
      </list-item>
      <list-item>
        <p>Third bullet with <strike>struck</strike> text</p>
      </list-item>
    </list>
    <list list-type="order">
      <list-item>
        <p>Step one</p>
      </list-item>
      <list-item>
        <p>Step two</p>
      </list-item>
      <list-item>
        <p>Step three</p>
      </list-item>
    </list>
    <def-list>
      <def-item>
        <term>Term One</term>
        <def>
          <p>Definition of the first term.</p>
        </def>
      </def-item>
    </def-list>
  </sec>
  <sec id="table-section">
    <title>Table Section</title>
    <table-wrap>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th align="left">Name</th>
            <th align="right">Quantity</th>
            <th align="center">Price</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td align="left">Apple</td>
            <td align="right">3</td>
            <td align="center">1.25</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td align="left">Banana</td>
            <td align="right">12</td>
            <td align="center">0.50</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td align="left">Cherry</td>
            <td align="right">100</td>
            <td align="center">9.99</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </table-wrap>
  </sec>
  <sec id="code-and-quotes">
    <title>Code and Quotes</title>
    <code language="python">def greet(name):
    return &quot;Hello, &quot; + name</code>
    <disp-quote>
      <p>Duis aute irure dolor in reprehenderit in voluptate velit esse
      cillum dolore eu fugiat nulla pariatur.</p>
    </disp-quote>
    <sec id="unicode-corner">
      <title>Unicode Corner</title>
      <p>Accents: café, naïve, Ærøskøbing. Greek: αβγδ. Chinese:
      汉字测试. Hebrew: שלום עולם. Arabic: مرحبا بالعالم. Emoji:
      🙂🚀.</p>
      <p>Footnote reference here.<xref ref-type="fn" rid="fn1">1</xref>
      Superscript x<sup>2</sup> and subscript H<sub>2</sub>O.</p>
      <fig>
        <caption><p>Tiny pixel</p></caption>
        <graphic mimetype="image" mime-subtype="png" xlink:href="pixel.png" />
      </fig>
      <p>Final paragraph with a
      <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="https://example.org/page">second
      link</ext-link> and an autolink
      <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="https://example.net/">https://example.net/</ext-link>.</p>
    </sec>
